<title>THAILAND: Thai grains discharge schedule for July 1.</title>
<headline>Thai grains discharge schedule for July 1.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shippers and surveyors detailed</p>
<p>grains discharges at Thai ports as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p> Vessel	    Date of Arrival    Commodity	     Amount</p>
<p> Hsing May	 July 04		ARG soybean	   54,328</p>
<p> Agia Fotia	July 04		BRZ.soymeal	   34,000</p>
<p>						ARG.sunflower meal   2,500</p>
<p> North Countess  July 05		BRZ.soymeal	   19,000</p>
<p>						BRZ.soybeans	   6,000</p>
<p> Bantay	    July 05		BRZ.soymeal		N/A</p>
<p>						ARG.sunflower meal     N/A</p>
<p> Joing Cheng     July 10		ARG.sunflower meal  10,688</p>
<p>Note: ARG = Argentina, AUS=Australia, US = United States, BRZ=Brazil.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
